Multi‑Hotel Room Booking System (Problem Statement)
Design a menu‑driven program to manage bookings across multiple hotels. Each hotel can have different room categories (e.g., Single, Double, Suite). The system should support the following operations:

Add Hotel
Add a new hotel with its name and room categories (each category has a count of available rooms).

Display Hotels
Show all hotels with their room categories and availability.

Book Room
Allow a customer to choose a hotel and room category, then book a room if available. Store the booking under the customer’s name.

Cancel Booking
Cancel a customer’s booking and restore the room availability.

Search Hotel
Search for a specific hotel and display its room availability.

Search Customer
Search by customer name to see which hotel and room category they booked.

Exit System
End the program gracefully.